    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0191","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Agnès O'Shaughnessy talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist brought a canvas, unwrapped it, looked at it, and wrapped it again.</Description>
